#description: A schema in the text refers to #Color, a definition declared at the top of the use package, outside the lineage. That is ref-outside-lineage.
#expect: E0142
#spec: docs/invariants.md:116-118, docs/invariants.md:221
#at: lin.h
-- in.cue --
import "github.com/sdboyer/thema"

#Color: "red" | "blue"
lin: h: thema.Lineage & {name: "h"}
-- text.cue --
schemas: "0": "0": schema: {c?: #Color}
-- out/compose/bind --
verdict: E0142
E0142 c in schema v0.0 refers to #Color, which is declared outside the lineage @ text.cue:1:33
-- out/together/bind --
verdict: E0142
E0142 c in schema v0.0 refers to #Color, which is declared outside the lineage @ /m/text.cue:2:42
